          {
            "id": "s2_8",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "Hello?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_9",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "Oh hello. I was hoping to speak to Jack Fitzgerald about renting a cottage.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_10",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "I'm his wife, Shirley, and we own the cottages together, so I'm sure I can help you.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_11",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "Great. My name's Tom. Some friends of ours rented Granary Cottage from you last year, and they thought it was great. So my wife and I are hoping to come in May for a week.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_12",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "What date did you have in mind?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_13",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "The week beginning the 14th, if possible.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_14",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "I'll just check … I'm sorry, Tom, it's already booked that week. It's free the week beginning the 28th, though, for seven nights. In fact, that's the only time you could have it in May.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_15",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "Oh. Well, we could manage that, I think. We'd just need to change a couple of things. How much would it cost?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
