        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s4_1",
            "speaker": "SPEAKER",
            "text": "-------",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_2",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "What about facilities in the cottage? It has standard things like a cooker and fridge, I presume.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_3",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "In the kitchen area there's a fridge-freezer and we've just put in an electric cooker.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_4",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "Is there a washing machine?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_5",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "Yes. There's also a TV in the living room, which plays DVDs too. The bathroom is too small for a bath, so there's a shower instead. I think a lot of people prefer that nowadays, anyway.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_6",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "It's more environmentally friendly, isn't it? Unless you spend half the day in it!",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_7",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "Exactly.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_8",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "What about heating? It sometimes gets quite cool at that time of year.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_9",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "There's central heating, and if you want to light a fire, there's a stove. We can provide all the wood you need for it. It smells so much nicer than coal, and it makes the room very cosy - we've got one in our own house.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_10",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "That sounds very pleasant. Perhaps we should come in the winter, to make the most of it!",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_11",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "Yes, we find we don't want to go out when we've got the fire burning. There are some attractive views from the cottage, which I haven't mentioned. There's a famous stone bridge - it's one of the oldest in the region, and you can see it from the living room. It isn't far away. The bedroom window looks in the opposite direction, and has a lovely view of the hills and the monument at the top.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_12",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "Well, that all sounds perfect. I'd like to book it, please. Would you want a deposit?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_13",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "Yes, we ask for thirty percent to secure your booking, so that'll be, um, £144.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_14",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "And when would you like the rest of the money?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_15",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "You're coming in May, so the last day of March, please.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_16",
            "speaker": "TOM",
            "text": "Fine.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_17",
            "speaker": "SHIRLEY",
            "text": "Excellent. Could I just take your details …",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
